<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xsd:schema xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
	targetNamespace="http://ei/core/CUWDocumentFiling"
	xmlns:bons0="http://ei/core/addressx1">
	<xsd:import schemaLocation="AddressX1.xsd"
		namespace="http://ei/core/addressx1">
	</xsd:import>
	<xsd:complexType name="CUWDocumentFiling">
		<xsd:sequence>


			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="Address"
				type="bons0:Address">
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="CUWDocumentKey"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element  is used to identify documents that have been  passed to CUW from many source systems.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="CUWDocumentReplacementIndicator" type="xsd:boolean">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element specifies whether the documents passed to CUW should be replaced.  Valid values for this element are 'Y' or 'N'.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="1" name="CUWDocumentStatusCode"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element represents the status of a document.  
Valid values for this element are 'P' - Private, 'C' - Published or 'D' - Draft. 
</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="1" name="CUWDataTypeName"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element defines the basic type of item stored.  
Valid values for this element are 'WORD', 'EXCEL', 'ACROBAT', 'TEXT', 'OS2V2BMP', 'WINBITMP', 'FAXTIFF'</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="1" name="DocumentTypeNumberCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element represents a code that identifies the relative Documerge print  location for a group of related forms.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DocumentDescription"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains a description of the document.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="1" name="DocumentCreatorUserId"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element represents the user id of the individual that created the document.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="1" name="DocumentOwnerUserId"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element represents the owner of a private document and contains the owner's user id</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0"
				name="DocumentContentBusinessEffectiveDate" type="xsd:date"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element represents the business date associated with the document.   </xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DocumentString"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the content of the document stored in a string data type.  </xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="DocumentByte"
				type="xsd:base64Binary"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element contains the content of the document stored in a base64Binary data type.    </xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="URL" type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>
This element contains a Uniform Resource Location, which is a simple and extensible means for locating a resource.
A URL consists of a schema: &lt;scheme&gt;:&lt;scheme-specific-part&gt;.  The list of valid schemes is registered with IANA (Internet Assigned Numbers Authority: http://www.iana.org http://www.iana.org)
Some valid schemes include ftp, file, and http. 





</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="OfferingNumber"
				type="xsd:string" maxOccurs="unbounded">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element is a unique identifier for each policy or submission in the Client / WIP system.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="CPNumber"
				type="xsd:string">
				<xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element is the number assigned to the contract partcipant.   A contract partcipant may be, but is not limited to, an insured, a prospective insured, a risk manager, an additional insured, or a Chubb resource.
</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element minOccurs="0" name="BranchCode"
				type="xsd:string"><xsd:annotation><xsd:documentation>This element specifies the code of the Chubb office that receives premium credit for a policy.
The E1T00031 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;BR_OFF_C&quot; column.</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>		</xsd:sequence>
	</xsd:complexType>
</xsd:schema>
